sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as You (phone)
  participant P as Telegram / WhatsApp
  participant N as n8n
  participant B as Brain
  participant O as OpenAI

  U->>P: voice note "remind me at 9 pm to call mom"
  P->>N: webhook (through the tunnel)
  N->>N: read message · download audio
  N->>B: message + audio
  B->>O: speech → text
  B->>B: agents do the work (same as web)
  B->>O: text → speech (you spoke, so it speaks back)
  B-->>N: reply text + audio
  N-->>P: send reply
  P-->>U: "⏰ Reminder set for 9 pm" + voice
  Note over U,B: Needs approval? You get "Reply YES / NO".<br/>Not linked yet? You get "send LINK code".
